{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the solution set of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169c0963e1725c18ebc90af4e8b9aafddeee0730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_6(x^3 + 4x^2 - 9x) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df876c17214e4236838811c5552651dc5eeb8e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\{-2, 2, 3\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\{-4, 3, 4\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\{-4, -3, 3\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\{-4, -3, 4\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\{2, 3, 4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"699\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d231ba960c49a4f3694369d1759ad4475d936959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{6}(x^{3} + 4x^{2} - 9x) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b82f3e2a2c13a12f94eb85ff02d3eeae10d01666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3} + 4x^{2} - 9x = 6^{2} = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0bf6b66c19f5828159c811aa73129ff15b92de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3} + 4x^{2} - 9x - 36 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4fcd4cfe35c79d006f4a8fe45b08ee9b02935a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}(x + 4) - 9(x + 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3f98faa042528ca04e8b5133f74b91e02addcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^{2} - 9)(x + 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a20c797e6828bb5776cc9f53e1bf07d68f7c9c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x + 3)(x + 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d924f912a4072521e9bb4c86d868591e01d0f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6ff35f9d605211aaffac6cca22719cfb090d91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. This best matches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/e/8ee8a57effedb9bf2790980289ec1e3191121e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\{-4, -3, 3\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"138\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 32 (page does not exist)\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2